        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #202124; line-height: 1.45;\">\n\n  <p>Hi {{ $json.name}},</p>\n\n  <p>Thank you for attending our recent FloLabs Internship orientation meeting. It was a pleasure having you with us and sharing our vision, as well as the exciting opportunities we’re building together.</p>\n\n  <p>At FloLabs, our internship offers multiple pathways - Internship, Apprenticeship, Fellowship, Scholar, Emerging Entrepreneur, and Entrepreneur in Residence, all designed to provide hands-on experience in real-world R&amp;D projects.</p>\n\n  <p>Our internship is designed to be flexible and supportive of your academic and personal commitments.</p>\n\n  <p>Here’s a quick overview of the structure:</p>\n\n  <p><strong>Total commitment:</strong> 500 hours</p>\n\n  <p><strong>450 hours:</strong> Hands-on work with our teams on real-life projects aligned with your background</p>\n\n  <p><strong>50+ hours:</strong> Masterclasses</p>\n\n  <p><strong>Weekly time commitment requirement:</strong> 8–10 hours per week minimum</p>\n\n  <p>This is an unpaid, experiential internship focused on helping participants develop expertise in AI and/or Robotics through applied learning.</p>\n\n  <p>Our records show that you missed part of the meeting, therefore I'm sending you below the recording of the session so you can watch any part that you missed or need to revisit:</p>\n\n  <p><a href=\"{{ $node[\"Extract Recording Link\"].json[\"recording_share_url\"] }}\">{{ $node[\"Extract Recording Link\"].json[\"recording_share_url\"] }}</a></p>\n\n  <p>If after you've watched what you missed from the Orientation Session you’re interested in moving forward, please go through the materials below which are part of our Masterclass. As you go through each item, share your reflections directly in the form:</p>\n\n  <p>👉<a href=\"https://flolabsrd.fillout.com/t/vDSyt4YMnTus\">https://flolabsrd.fillout.com/t/vDSyt4YMnTus</a></p>\n\n  <p>Please note that we use AI engagement tools to assess responses - your answers must be authentic and thoughtful. Submissions generated by AI tools or lacking genuine input may lead to cancellation of your application.</p>\n\n  <p>Once submitted, you’ll meet with Oliver for an overview, followed by your final interview with John Hazlewood to discuss your goals and next steps.</p>\n\n  <p>We look forward to your submission and the chance to collaborate with you soon.</p>\n\n</div>",
